<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Azucena IWR32

This macro is made to instantly trigger Azucena while running 32, which gives her good frame advantage.

This is for left side only

Buttons: 3 = K  2 = I

I use this macro all the time &amp; succesfully in ruler ranks, mix it with good movement to hide the fact that it's instantaneous.</Description>
    <Comment>Have fun with it, it's OP</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 79 1
Delay 20 ms
KeyUp 79 1
Delay 20 ms
KeyDown 79 1
Delay 20 ms
KeyUp 79 1
Delay 20 ms
KeyDown 79 1
Delay 20 ms
KeyDown 14 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 14 1
Delay 64
Delay 20 ms
KeyUp 79 1
KeyDown 12 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 12 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Tekken 8</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>